It can do lots of different things.  It's a very powerful wand, so be
careful.  It removed the magic ability from monsters and items.
For instance, it removes the nymph's ability to charm you and her ability
to teleport, like you said.  It will remove a floating eye's ability to
freeze you, a Dragon's ability to breathe on you, etc.  I've never really
tested one out fully.  But I do know it will turn potions into water and
will turn normal scrolls in blank ones.  It should remove curses and the
+/- of armor and weapons too.  So be careful!

